        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, we're here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's wrong？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>N-Nothing.
...I mean,
are you fine with this？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Staying overnight together.
It's our first time.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>F-For now, let's head inside.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(I'm getting nervous...)</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Have you gotten used to
this sort of thing yet？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No way.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Right？ Me neither.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Front Desk</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Welcome! Thank you for
visiting Hotel Ohnoya.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I have a reservation
under ▲苗字▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Let's go, ▲小早川＊▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yeah.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Want me to carry your bag？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oh, aren't you considerate!</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I made you walk a lot
today, after all.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Then I'll take you up
on that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder how we look to
the people around us.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm, don't we just look
like a normal couple？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe you look like an
adorable wife, ▲小早川＊▲.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>J-Just kidding.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You really have no taste.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And what's 'adorable'
supposed to mean？ What am
I, a small animal？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(So she's choosing not to
react to the 'wife' part.)</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
