          <Dialog>Eh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What's going on with the rooms？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm sure I booked
separate rooms, though...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>How was it？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>They said it was a mix-up.
And it looks like they're
all booked up... Now what？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Did you do this on purpose？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I didn't! I'll go talk
to them one more time.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Forget it, it's fine.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm saying it's fine to share a room.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲小早川＊▲……。</Dialog>
          <Dialog>We're on a trip together.
Separate rooms is weird.
I want to be with you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Still, taking it for granted
that we'll share a room...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What, would you rather get
separate rooms for a change？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'd hate that even more.
...That's why I'm putting
up with it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>(Is she really？)</Dialog>
