        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>Kobayakawa</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'm thirsty. I'm going
to go buy some juice.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>See you in a bit.
Don't get sidetracked,
